    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm having one of those crazy migraines again. it hit me super fast, like in like a second, just a massive thud of pain. feeling a bit nauseous too. i usually take my sumatriptan for these but this one feels kinda more intense than usual... should i just double up on the dose to get ahead of it or is that bad?",
