    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "uugh i know, i'm always paranoid about the doc thing. but i've had migraines for years and it's usually just a bad flare up. it's not like i've ever had a stroke or anything lol. plus going to the er is such a massive pain and so expensive. do u really think it's that serious? can't i just try taking an extra pill and see if it settles down in an hour?",
